### Create an event draft
POST http://localhost:8081/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Organizer-Id: 3f2b6c1e-8a4d-4f7e-9b1a-2c5d7e9f0a11

{
  "title": "Rock Night",
  "description": "Live music all night long",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-14T19:00:00Z",
  "venue": {
    "name": "Tauron Arena",
    "city": "Kraków",
    "address": "ul. Stanisława Lema 7"
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("eventUrl", response.headers.valueOf("Location")); %}

### Read the created event
GET http://localhost:8081{{eventUrl}}

### Validation error (event in the past) → 400 problem detail
POST http://localhost:8081/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Organizer-Id: 3f2b6c1e-8a4d-4f7e-9b1a-2c5d7e9f0a11

{
  "title": "Too late",
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T19:00:00Z",
  "venue": { "name": "Somewhere", "city": "Kraków", "address": "Street 1" }
}
